	(text "LED_EN high turns the LED rail on. It is off by default (R12) and must be off in sleep:\n19 LEDs idle at 0.6 mA each. C10 (gate to drain) and R13 make the rail rise over about 1.5 ms,\nso switching the LEDs on does not dip the battery and reset the module.\nThe LEDs run from the battery, never from USB 5 V: their input threshold is 0.65 x VLED,\nwhich 3.3 V logic meets at 4.2 V but not at 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "049210f4-4333-5c7b-9723-bc051bcaf2a1")
	)
